KARB-O-BALA MEIN BAGH-E-PAYAMBER UJARD GAYA<br>
<br>
Karbobala mein bagh-e-payamber ujard gaya<br>
Maidaan-e-Karbala mein bhara ghar ujard gaya<br>
Saidaniyon ka haye muqaddar bikhar gaya<br>
Khawhar se haye aik baradar bichard gaya<br>
<br>
Farwa ke laal ibne Hasan kaam aa chuke<br>
Chote se haye Asghar-e-Nadaan ja chuke<br>
Akber sina-e-zulm kaleje pe kha chuke<br>
Maidaan-e-Karbala mein bhi Shabbir aa chuke<br>
<br>
Zainul Abideen ko dekh ke kafer rodiye<br>
Paoon mein bedi daal ke jo khoo&rsquo;n khawr rodiye<br>
Touq-e-garaa&rsquo;n pehna ke jafakaar rodiye<br>
Moula ki bekasi pe khatakaar rodiye<br>
<br>
Kafer leke jayen darbar-e-sham mein<br>
Masoom beqarar hai yaad-e-imam mein<br>
Binte Ali pohunch gaye zindan-e-sham mein<br>
Moula ki bekasi pe khatakaar rodiye<br>
<br>
Kehta hai sar ko peet ke Zainul Abbas Hussain<br>
